[00:00.00]Hello, everyone, and welcome back to Mr. English Channel, where learning English is easy and fun.|大家好，欢迎回到 Mr. English Channel——在这里，学英语既轻松又有趣。
[00:11.68]I'm Emily.|我是 Emily。
[00:13.04]Hello, Emily. Hello, everyone. It is so good to be here today. I'm Paul. How are you today, Emily?|你好，Emily。大家好。今天能来真好。我是 Paul。Emily，你今天怎么样？
[00:21.20]I am great, Paul. I am happy. I have my coffee, and I am ready to talk. How are you?|我很好，Paul。我很开心。我有我的咖啡，准备好聊天了。你呢？
[00:29.20]I am very good, thank you. I am ready, too. Today, hmm, today we have a big topic, a very important topic.|我很好，谢谢。我也准备好了。今天，嗯，今天我们有一个大话题，一个非常重要的话题。
[00:40.62]Oh, a big topic? I like big topics. What is it?|哦，大话题？我喜欢大话题。是什么？
[00:46.24]The topic today is, don't stop when you're tired, stop when you're done.|今天的话题是：别在累的时候停下，要在做完的时候停下。
[00:53.14]Ooh, don't stop when you're tired.|哦，别在累的时候停下。
[00:57.00]Stop when you're done.|要在做完的时候停下。
[00:59.28]Wow, that is strong, Paul.|哇，这话很有力量，Paul。
[01:02.86]It is strong, but it is very, very good.|是很有力量，但也非常非常好。
[01:06.74]It is about continuing, not stopping.|它讲的是继续，而不是停下。
[01:10.44]I love this.|我喜欢这个。
[01:12.02]This is so important for learning English, yes?|这对学英语特别重要，对吧？
[01:15.14]Oh, yes.|哦，是的。
[01:16.62]For English, for work, for cleaning the house.|对英语、对工作、对打扫屋子都一样。
[01:22.52]Oh, yes. Cleaning the house.|哦，是的，打扫屋子。
[01:27.24]Okay, Paul. I am ready.|好，Paul。我准备好了。
[01:29.72]Don't stop when you're tired. Stop when you're done.|别在累的时候停下，要在做完的时候停下。
[01:34.80]Okay, let's talk.|好，我们聊聊。
[01:37.48]First, tired.|先说「累」。
[01:40.18]What is tired, Emily?|Emily，「累」是什么？
[01:42.56]Hmm, tired.|嗯，累。
[01:45.14]Tired is my eyes are sleepy.|累就是我的眼睛困了。
[01:48.60]I want my bed.|我想要我的床。
[01:50.58]I want my pillow.|我想要我的枕头。
[01:52.52]My body is slow.|我的身体变慢了。
[01:55.62]Yes, that is a perfect description.|对，这描述太准确了。
[01:58.96]You are sleepy.|你困了。
[02:00.44]You want to rest.|你想休息。
[02:01.70]You want the sofa.|你想要沙发。
[02:03.68]Yes, I love the sofa.|对，我爱沙发。
[02:06.86]And done?|那「做完」呢？
[02:08.46]What is done?|「做完」是什么意思？
[02:09.32]Ah, done is finished, complete.|啊，「做完」就是完成、结束。
[02:14.40]The job is zero.|活儿清零了。
[02:16.66]The job is finished.|活儿干完了。
[02:18.66]Finished, yes.|完成了，对。
[02:20.26]My homework is done.|我的作业做完了。
[02:23.26]My food is done.|我的饭做好了。
[02:25.74]The work is finished.|工作完成了。
[02:28.16]Exactly.|正是。
[02:29.38]So the idea is don't stop when you feel sleepy.|所以这个意思是：别在你困的时候停下，
[02:35.06]Stop when the work is finished.|要在活儿干完的时候停下。
[02:39.02]This is hard, Paul.|这很难，Paul。
[02:40.82]This is very hard.|这非常难。
[02:42.62]I know.|我知道。
[02:44.10]I know it is hard.|我知道这很难。
[02:45.92]Let's think about learning English.|我们想想学英语。
[02:50.26]Okay, yes, our students are learning English.|好，对，我们的学生都在学英语。
[02:54.90]Yes, and learning English is a big job.|对，学英语是件大工程。
[02:58.80]It is not fast.|它不快。
[03:01.04]No, it is not one day.|不，不是一天的事。
[03:03.70]I study, I listen, I read, and my brain is tired.|我学、我听、我读，然后我的脑子累了。
[03:11.54]Yes, my brain is tired too.|对，我的脑子也累。
[03:15.54]Sometimes I read a book in English.|有时我读一本英语书。
[03:18.96]I read one page.|我读一页。
[03:21.08]Okay.|好。
[03:21.78]Two pages.|两页。
[03:23.44]Okay.|好。
[03:24.58]Uh-huh.|嗯哼。
[03:25.30]Three pages.|三页。
[03:26.92]My eyes are sleepy.|我的眼睛困了。
[03:29.48]I am tired.|我累了。
[03:30.66]I want to close the book.|我想把书合上。
[03:33.30]Yes.|对。
[03:34.54]You want to close the book and watch TV.|你想合上书去看电视。
[03:38.96]Yes.|对。
[03:40.54]TV is easy.|电视很轻松。
[03:42.66]English is work.|英语是活儿。
[03:45.32]But is the chapter done?|但这一章读完了吗？
[03:47.60]Is the lesson done?|这一课学完了吗？
[03:49.64]No.|没有。
[03:50.38]No.|没有。
[03:51.34]The lesson is not done.|这一课还没学完。
[03:53.98]So, I am tired, but I must continue.|所以，我累了，但我必须继续。
[03:58.90]I must keep going.|我必须坚持下去。
[04:01.08]Hmm.|嗯。
[04:02.30]Keep going.|坚持下去。
[04:04.10]But how, Paul?|可是怎么坚持呢，Paul？
[04:05.62]I am so tired.|我太累了。
[04:07.54]Okay.|好。
[04:08.56]Good question.|好问题。
[04:10.16]Maybe the goal is too big.|也许目标太大了。
[04:13.36]Maybe the goal is read the book.|也许目标是「读完这本书」。
[04:16.70]That is too big.|那太大了。
[04:19.50]Yes, a whole book.|对，整整一本书。
[04:22.06]Let's make a small goal.|我们定个小目标吧。
[04:24.94]The goal is read two pages or read for ten minutes.|目标是读两页，或者读十分钟。
[04:31.98]Ah, ten minutes.|啊，十分钟。
[04:33.82]Okay.|好。
[04:34.72]I am tired, but I can do ten minutes.|我累了，但十分钟我能做到。
[04:39.18]Ten minutes is small.|十分钟很小。
[04:40.96]Yes, it is small.|对，它很小。
[04:42.46]So you read for 10 minutes.|所以你读了 10 分钟。
[04:45.68]You are tired, but you read.|你累了，但你读了。
[04:48.86]And then, ding, 10 minutes.|然后，叮，十分钟到了。
[04:52.84]I am done.|我做完了。
[04:54.12]You are done.|你做完了。
[04:56.08]Yes, done for today.|对，今天做完了。
[04:58.70]Wow, that is great.|哇，太棒了。
[05:02.80]I am tired and I am done.|我累了，而且我做完了。
[05:07.94]Yes.|对。
[05:09.16]And how do you feel?|那你感觉怎么样？
[05:10.34]You feel tired, but you also feel good.|你觉得累，但你也感觉很好。
[05:14.22]You feel, I did it.|你会有种「我做到了」的感觉。
[05:16.94]Yes, I did it.|对，我做到了。
[05:19.22]I am good.|我很棒。
[05:20.48]I studied my English.|我学了英语。
[05:22.62]But if you stop, you are tired, you close the book, you watch TV.|但如果你停下了——你累了，合上书，去看电视。
[05:29.02]How do you feel later?|之后你会感觉怎么样？
[05:31.68]Later I feel bad.|之后我会觉得难受。
[05:35.66]Bad?|难受？
[05:36.64]Why?|为什么？
[05:37.64]Because I did not study.|因为我没学。
[05:39.24]The TV was okay, but my English? No progress.|电视还行，但我的英语？毫无进步。
[05:44.48]Exactly. You are tired and you are sad. That is not good.|正是。你又累又难过。这不好。
[05:51.18]No. Tired and sad is very bad.|不。又累又难过，太糟了。
[05:56.78]I like tired and happy. Tired and happy is much better.|我喜欢又累又开心。又累又开心好多了。
[06:02.12]Me too. Okay, so small steps. The goal is done for today.|我也是。好，所以就是小步走。目标就是「今天做完了」。
[06:11.18]Yes. Let's think of exercise.|对。我们想想运动。
[06:15.30]Exercise. Okay.|运动。好。
[06:16.98]Do you like exercise, Emily?|Emily，你喜欢运动吗？
[06:18.98]I like to walk.|我喜欢走路。
[06:22.52]Walking is good. Walking is great exercise.|走路很好。走路是很好的运动。
[06:26.76]Yes, I like to walk in the park. My goal, my plan, is to walk for 30 minutes.|对，我喜欢在公园走路。我的目标、我的计划，是走 30 分钟。
[06:36.78]30 minutes. Okay, that is a good goal.|30 分钟。好，这是个好目标。
[06:40.76]I start, I walk. 5 minutes, easy. 10 minutes, I am good.|我开始走。5 分钟，很轻松。10 分钟，我还行。
[06:48.00]Uh-huh.|嗯哼。
[06:48.62]15 minutes, I am tired. My legs are tired, I am hot.|15 分钟，我累了。腿累了，身上很热。
[06:55.42]I know this feeling. And you see a chair. A nice, comfortable chair.|我懂这种感觉。然后你看到一把椅子，一把又好看又舒服的椅子。
[07:04.08]Yes. The chair calls my name. Emily, sit. Rest.|对。那把椅子在叫我名字：「Emily，坐下。休息吧。」
[07:11.98]Hello, Emily.|「你好呀，Emily。」
[07:14.26]And I am so tired, I want to stop.|我太累了，我想停下。
[07:17.76]But what is the goal?|但目标是什么？
[07:19.96]The goal is 30 minutes.|目标是 30 分钟。
[07:22.38]And you are at 15 minutes.|而你现在才 15 分钟。
[07:26.30]Yes, I am tired. I am not done.|对，我累了。但我没做完。
[07:29.84]Ah, see? This is the moment, the important moment. What do you do?|啊，看到了吗？就是这个时刻，关键的时刻。你怎么办？
[07:36.68]I think about tired and sad.|我想想「又累又难过」。
[07:41.68]Good.|很好。
[07:42.92]I don't want tired and sad. I want tired and happy. So I must continue.|我不想要又累又难过。我想要又累又开心。所以我必须继续。
[07:48.74]Yes, keep going. Maybe walk slow. Not fast, just slow.|对，继续。也许走慢一点。不用快，就慢走。
[07:56.06]Okay, a small step, I walk slow. 20 minutes, 25 minutes.|好，小步走，我慢慢走。20 分钟，25 分钟。
[08:02.56]You are almost there.|你快到了。
[08:04.18]30 minutes. Finished. Done.|30 分钟。完成了。做完了。
[08:07.72]Wow, good job, Emily. And now, how do you feel?|哇，干得好，Emily。现在你感觉怎么样？
[08:12.42]I am very tired, but I am, wow, I feel strong. I feel happy. I did it.|我很累，但我——哇，我觉得自己很强。我很开心。我做到了。
[08:22.60]Yes, you finished your goal. You are done. Now you can sit on the chair.|对，你完成了目标。你做完了。现在你可以坐那把椅子了。
[08:29.94]Ah, yes. Now the chair is a prize.|啊，对。现在那把椅子是奖品。
[08:34.12]A prize, yes. A reward. You work, then you rest.|奖品，对。一份奖赏。先干活，再休息。
[08:39.68]Oh, I like that. The rest is a prize. It is not stopping. It is finishing.|哦，我喜欢这个。休息是奖品，不是停下，是完成。
[08:46.32]Yes, you earned the rest. Good job.|对，你挣来了这份休息。干得好。
[08:50.02]This is very good. Okay, English, exercise. What about the kitchen?|这很好。好，英语、运动。那厨房呢？
[08:57.46]Oh no, the kitchen.|哦不，厨房。
[09:00.32]After dinner, I cook, I eat, the food is good, I am full, I am happy, and I am...|晚饭后，我做饭、吃饭，饭很好吃，我吃饱了，我很开心，然后我……
[09:09.04]Very tired.|非常累。
[09:11.18]Yes, very, very tired.|对，非常非常累。
[09:14.20]I look at the kitchen.|我看看厨房。
[09:16.62]There are plates, glasses, pots.|有盘子、杯子、锅。
[09:20.24]It is a big job, a big, dirty job.|这是一大摊活儿，又大又脏。
[09:24.96]And my sofa, my sofa is calling.|而我的沙发，我的沙发在召唤我。
[09:28.42]Emily, TV.|「Emily，电视。」
[09:30.56]The sofa is always calling.|沙发总是在召唤。
[09:32.96]I am so tired.|我太累了。
[09:35.00]I think, hmm, maybe tomorrow.|我想，嗯，也许明天吧。
[09:39.04]Ah, tomorrow. The bad word.|啊，明天。这个坏词。
[09:45.64]Yes, tomorrow is bad. Why?|对，明天是坏的。为什么？
[09:49.84]Because you go to sleep, you wake up, the morning is new, you go to the kitchen.|因为你睡一觉，醒来，新的一天开始了，你走进厨房，
[09:58.22]And the kitchen is dirty.|厨房还是脏的。
[10:01.70]Yes, the plates are still there, the pots are still there.|对，盘子还在那儿，锅还在那儿。
[10:06.38]Oh, and now I am not tired, but I am sad. Sad morning.|哦，现在我不累了，但我很难过。难过的早晨。
[10:13.28]Sad morning. It is a bad start to the day.|难过的早晨。这是一天的糟糕开始。
[10:16.92]Okay, so back to dinner. I am tired. I look at the kitchen.|好，回到晚饭后。我累了，我看看厨房。
[10:23.44]What do you do?|你怎么办？
[10:24.80]I say, no, Emily, not tomorrow. Now.|我说：不，Emily，不是明天。是现在。
[10:30.24]Good.|很好。
[10:30.74]I stop when I am done. So I wash the plates.|我要在做完时停下。所以我洗盘子。
[10:35.44]I wash the glasses. I clean the table. It is maybe 20 minutes.|我洗杯子，擦桌子。大概 20 分钟。
[10:42.06]It is work. I am tired.|这是活儿。我累了。
[10:44.86]But?|但是呢？
[10:45.74]But it is done. The kitchen is clean.|但是它做完了。厨房干净了。
[10:49.86]Yes.|对。
[10:50.68]And now I go to the sofa.|现在我去沙发那儿。
[10:53.36]Ah, and how is the sofa now?|啊，那现在沙发感觉怎么样？
[10:56.92]The sofa is wonderful.|沙发太棒了。
[11:00.74]It is the best sofa. I am tired, but I am proud.|它是最好的沙发。我累了，但我很自豪。
[11:05.58]Proud. That is a great word. Proud is, I did a good job.|「Proud」（自豪）。这是个好词。自豪就是：我干得不错。
[11:10.94]Yes, I am proud. The kitchen is clean. I am happy. I can relax.|对，我很自豪。厨房干净了。我很开心。我可以放松了。
[11:18.40]See? The hard choice, cleaning, makes you happy later.|看到了吗？那个难的选择——打扫，会让你之后开心。
[11:24.18]And the easy choice, tomorrow, makes me sad later.|而那个容易的选择——「明天吧」，会让我之后难过。
[11:28.62]Yes, exactly. Don't stop when you're tired. Stop when you're done. It is about feeling good after the work.|对，正是。别在累的时候停下，要在做完的时候停下。它讲的是干完活之后那种舒服的感觉。
[11:39.70]I understand. The work, study, exercise, cleaning, it is not always fun.|我明白了。工作、学习、运动、打扫，并不总是好玩的。
[11:48.22]No, it is work.|不，那是活儿。
[11:52.16]But the feeling, the done feeling, that is fun.|但那种感觉——「做完了」的感觉，是好玩的。
[11:55.90]Yes, the done feeling is the prize.|对，「做完了」的感觉就是奖品。
[12:00.50]So, Paul, this is a big idea, but why is it so hard? Why do we always want to stop?|那么 Paul，这是个很大的道理，但为什么这么难？为什么我们总想停下？
[12:09.72]Hmm, that is a good question. I think our body, our brain, wants to be comfortable.|嗯，好问题。我觉得我们的身体、我们的大脑，都想舒服。
[12:20.00]Comfortable, yes. The sofa is comfortable. The bed is comfortable.|舒服，对。沙发舒服，床舒服。
[12:25.82]Yes, and work is not comfortable.|对，而干活不舒服。
[12:29.90]No, work is not comfortable.|不，干活不舒服。
[12:34.28]So, our brain says, stop, go to comfort, go to the sofa.|所以我们的大脑说：停下，去舒服的地方，去沙发。
[12:42.30]Yes, my brain says that.|对，我的大脑就这么说。
[12:45.02]But comfortable is not progress.|但舒服不是进步。
[12:50.62]Progress? What is progress?|进步？进步是什么？
[12:53.26]Progress is moving forward, getting better, learning new things.|进步就是往前走、变得更好、学新东西。
[13:01.82]Ah, progress is learning 10 new English words.|啊，进步就是学会 10 个新英语单词。
[13:07.62]Yes, progress is walking 30 minutes, not 15.|对，进步就是走 30 分钟，而不是 15 分钟。
[13:13.60]Progress is a clean kitchen.|进步就是一个干净的厨房。
[13:18.50]Yes. And progress, that makes us happy. Very, very happy.|对。而进步让我们开心，非常非常开心。
[13:26.64]So comfortable now is so, so happy. Work now is very happy later.|所以「现在图舒服」是「以后难受」，而「现在干活」是「以后很开心」。（注：原话此处有口误，已按正确逻辑译出）
[13:37.52]That is it. You said it perfectly. Work now, happy later.|就是这样。你说得太到位了。
[13:43.60]Okay, so I am tired. I want to stop. What is the secret? What do I do?|好，所以我累了，我想停下。秘诀是什么？我该怎么办？
[13:52.44]Okay, secret number one. Remember the goal. Why did you start?|好，秘诀第一条：记住目标。你当初为什么开始？
[14:01.50]Okay, the goal. I started English because I want to travel. I want to meet new people.|好，目标。我学英语是因为我想旅行，我想认识新朋友。
[14:10.68]Good. So when you are tired, think travel. Think new friends. Don't think tired.|很好。所以累的时候，想旅行，想新朋友，别想着累。
[14:22.04]Mmm. Okay. Focus on the goal. Good. What is secret number two?|嗯。好，专注目标。很好。秘诀第二条是什么？
[14:30.06]Secret number two. Make the step small.|秘诀第二条：把步子迈小。
[14:35.10]Ah, yes. Ten minutes.|啊对，十分钟。
[14:37.34]Yes. Don't think, I must study for three hours. No, that is too big.|对。别想「我必须学三小时」。不，那太大了。
[14:46.30]Yes. Three hours, I go to bed.|对。三小时，我直接去睡觉了。
[14:50.72]Me too. Think, I must finish one lesson. Or, I must write five sentences.|我也是。想「我必须学完一课」，或者「我必须写五个句子」。
[15:00.32]Small. Easy.|小，容易。
[15:01.72]Small goals are easy to finish. And when you finish one small goal, you feel good.|小目标容易完成。完成一个小目标，你就会感觉很好。
[15:09.34]Yes, I am done.|对，我做完了。
[15:11.84]And maybe you have energy for one more small goal.|也许你还有力气再完成一个小目标。
[15:17.08]Ooh, yes. Okay. Five more minutes.|哦，对。好，再来五分钟。
[15:21.78]Exactly. Small steps make a big journey.|正是。小步走，才能走完长路。
[15:26.34]Wow! Okay. Goal and small steps. Is there a secret number three?|哇！好，目标和小的步子。还有第三条秘诀吗？
[15:33.84]Hmm. Yes. Secret number three, the prize.|嗯，有。秘诀第三条：奖品。
[15:40.50]The prize! I like prizes.|奖品！我喜欢奖品。
[15:44.38]Me too. The prize is after the work.|我也是。奖品在干活之后。
[15:50.42]Yes. The sofa is the prize after the kitchen is done.|对。厨房干完之后，沙发就是奖品。
[15:56.20]Yes! My prize is coffee. I finish my study, then I have a nice coffee.|对！我的奖品是咖啡。学完习，我就喝一杯好咖啡。
[16:05.94]My prize is music. I finish my walk, then I listen to my favorite songs.|我的奖品是音乐。走完路，我就听我最喜欢的歌。
[16:12.62]That is perfect. The prize helps you finish. It helps you get to done.|太完美了。奖品帮你完成，帮你走到「做完」。
[16:19.16]This is great, Paul.|这太棒了，Paul。
[16:21.78]1. Remember the goal.|第一，记住目标。
